1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Kur buvai vakar vakare?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Buvau pas seserá, prie stoties.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,500
Turëjai man paskambinti. Að nerimavau.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
Atsipraðau, mano telefonas iðsikrovë.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,500
Nieko tokio. Ar vakarieniausime ðiandien kartu?

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Mielai. Noriu á tà restoranà prie upës.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Gerai, pasimatysime vëliau.
